 "remarks": "Downtown Darien's Corbin District  Experience downtown living in this stunning 980 square-foot residence located at 15 Corbin Drive. This beautifully designed residence offers an incredibly spacious open concept chefs' kitchen with quartz countertops/ living area with oversize windows and tons of natural light with 9ft+ ceilings. In addition, there is a generous bedroom, with en suite bathroom. There is a convenient half bath off the main living area. Building amenities include access to a shared rooftop terrace/courtyard, elevator service from a secure lower-level garage, and professional management.  This residence perfectly blends modern luxury with an unbeatable location in Downtown Darien with walk to shops, restaurants, and fitness options.  (photos are representative of similar unit and may not be actual unit)",
